    {
      "id": "MW-C155-jau-javai",
      "sequence": 9620,
      "title": "हूं जाऊं हूं — a stem that ends in a vowel",
      "headword": "जाऊं · जावै",
      "romanization": "jāū̃ · jāvai",
      "gloss": "I go, he goes: a stem that ends in a vowel",
      "script": "devanagari",
      "modality": "voice",
      "derivedModality": "voice",
      "modalityReasons": [
        "no-visual-dependency"
      ],
      "sourceHash": "fnv1a64:8af69e97235e2d5d",
      "notice": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Say to go, जाणो. Then I listen to songs and he listens to songs. And the market, बाजार."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "grammar",
          "title": "Grammar Lens: जा",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "जाणो leaves जा, a stem that ends in a vowel. For I, its ending is the full letter ऊं:"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हूं रोज बाजार जाऊं हूं। hū̃ roj bājār jāū̃ hū̃. — I go to the market every day."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "For वो, a व comes in before -ै:"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "वो रोज बाजार जावै है। vo roj bājār jāvai hai. — He goes to the market every day."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "After आप, the व stays: आप जावो हो, the ending of the request लावो. CDIAL lists Old Marwari jāvaï, \"to go\", with the same -aï (CDIAL 10452). जाऊं is central Marwari as this book writes it; other districts differ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "हूं रोज बाजार जाऊं हूं। — hū̃ roj bājār jāū̃ hū̃. — I go to the market every day.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: **हूं रोज बाजार जाऊं हूं।** — *hū̃ roj bājār jāū̃ hū̃.* — I go to the market every day.]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "मां रोज बाजार जावै है। — mā̃ roj bājār jāvai hai. — Mother goes to the market every day.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: **मां रोज बाजार जावै है।** — *mā̃ roj bājār jāvai hai.* — Mother goes to the market every day.]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "आप बाजार जावो हो। — āp bājār jāvo ho. — You go to the market.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: **आप बाजार जावो हो।** — *āp bājār jāvo ho.* — You go to the market.]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "I go? (जाऊं हूं.) He goes? (जावै है.) You go, to आप? (जावो हो.)"
            },
            {
              "kind": "activity",
              "scored": true,
              "spoken": true,
              "id": "MW-C155-jau-javai-market",
              "prompt": "Say that he goes to the market every day.",
              "assesses": [
                "MW-GRAMMAR-C155-VSTEM-01"
              ],
              "responseSeconds": 15,
              "acceptedResponses": [
                "वो रोज बाजार जावै है।",
                "vo roj bājār jāvai hai",
                "vo roj bajar javai hai"
              ],
              "feedback": {
                "correct": "Right: जा, then व, then -ै है.",
                "incorrect": "For वो, जा takes a व before -ै: जावै है."
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MW-C155-khau-pivai",
      "sequence": 9630,
      "title": "खा, पी, आ — three more vowel stems",
      "headword": "खाऊं · पीवै · आवै",
      "romanization": "khāū̃ · pīvai · āvai",
      "gloss": "eat, drink, come: three more vowel stems that go like जा",
      "script": "devanagari",
      "modality": "voice",
      "derivedModality": "voice",
      "modalityReasons": [
        "no-visual-dependency"
      ],
      "sourceHash": "fnv1a64:0216f556d2fee35c",
      "notice": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Say I go to the market every day. Then to eat, to drink, to come: खाणो, पीणो, आवणो."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "grammar",
          "title": "Grammar Lens: the same three endings",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "खा, पी and आ end in vowels, and go exactly like जा:"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हूं रोज दिनूगै चाय पीऊं हूं। hū̃ roj dinūgai chāy pīū̃ hū̃. — I drink tea early every morning."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "राम रोटी खावै है। rām roṭī khāvai hai. — Ram eats roti."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आप रोज आवो हो। āp roj āvo ho. — You come every day."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आवणो leaves आव, but its present follows जा: आऊं, आवै, आवो. Old Marwari had āvaï, \"comes\" (CDIAL 1200)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
