                "who: आप. बोल-: बोलो हो. जा-: जावो हो."
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "हूं रोटी खाऊं हूं। — hū̃ roṭī khāū̃ hū̃. — I eat roti.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: **हूं रोटी खाऊं हूं।** — *hū̃ roṭī khāū̃ hū̃.* — I eat roti.]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "वो चाय पीवै है। — vo chāy pīvai hai. — He drinks tea.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: **वो चाय पीवै है।** — *vo chāy pīvai hai.* — He drinks tea.]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "वो रोज आवै है। — vo roj āvai hai. — He comes every day.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: **वो रोज आवै है।** — *vo roj āvai hai.* — He comes every day.]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "He eats? (खावै है.) I come? (आऊं हूं.) You drink, to आप? (पीवो हो.)"
            },
            {
              "kind": "activity",
              "scored": true,
              "spoken": true,
              "id": "MW-C155-khau-pivai-tea",
              "prompt": "Say that you drink tea early every morning.",
              "assesses": [
                "MW-GRAMMAR-C155-VSTEM-MORE-01"
              ],
              "responseSeconds": 15,
              "acceptedResponses": [
                "हूं रोज दिनूगै चाय पीऊं हूं।",
                "hū̃ roj dinūgai chāy pīū̃ hū̃",
                "hu roj dinugai chay piu hu"
